#%PAM-1.0
# The old password database alone, for tilo-authd: the first time someone's
# old password is accepted here, tilo-authd moves them onto their user key and
# locks the shadow entry. tilo-authd runs it as root through
# tilo-unlock-helper; no sign-in surface uses this service.
auth       required     pam_unix.so
account    required     pam_unix.so
